GitHubRepositoryShape
GitTagShape
GraphQLErrorEntry
MergeMethod
PullRequestCommentShape
PullRequestShape
RestData
RestExtras
RestItem
RestPaginatingRoute
RestParams
RestResponse
WorkflowDispatchShape

# commands — detail types of already-documented Run/ToolDiscovery/LocalExec
# surfaces; REDACTED is the literal mask-string constant Redaction uses.
Launcher
REDACTED
ResolvedSource
ToolDiscoveryShape
ToolResolutionFailure

# npm — detail types/predicates of the already-documented DependencySpecifier
# and IntegrityHash brands, and NpmRegistry's seeded-double value shape.
ClassifiedSpecifier
IntegrityAlgorithm
isValidDependencySpecifier
isValidIntegrityHash
SeededVersion

# schemastore — KNOWN GAP, not a detail-type exemption: this package has no
# references/ file in effected-packages (round-1 audit finding, tracked
# separately). Every top-level export is genuinely uncovered by the plugin
# today, including substantial ones (AnnotationCarriers, CanonicalJson,
# CatalogEntry, KeywordFamilies, SchemaTarget, SchemaVersioning, StoreDocument
# is covered by name via CLAUDE.md pointers elsewhere but its options/error
# types are not) — allow-listed so this check can ship without blocking on
# authoring a full package reference in the same change. Writing
# references/schemastore.md removes this whole block, not just entries.
AnnotationCarriers
CanonicalJson
CanonicalJsonError
CanonicalJsonOptions
CarrierDepthExceededError
CatalogEntry
CatalogLintFinding
CatalogUrls
DocumentLintFinding
DRAFT_07_META_SCHEMA
InvalidSchemaVersionError
JsonDepthExceededError
KeywordFamilies
NonJsonValueError
SchemaConversionError
SchemaFileNotFoundError
SchemaFileReadError
SchemaFileShape
SchemaFileWriteError
SchemaTarget
SchemaValidatorError
SchemaValidatorOptions
SchemaValidatorShape
SchemaVersion
SchemaVersioning
StoreDocumentOptions
ValidationFinding
WriteOutcome

# jsonl — detail types of the already-documented Envelope/Journal/JsonlEvent/
# Line surfaces.
AppendOptions
DataSchema
EnvelopeOf
EnvelopeUnion
EnvelopeWithTag
JournalClass
JournalConfig
JournalReadError
JournalWriteError
